description:
Develop a square wave generator that produces a square wave output at a frequency determined by an input clock signal. The circuit toggles the output state between high and low every half-period based on the clock frequency, while being reset by an active-low reset signal. The output frequency is set to half of the input clock frequency, making it a divide-by-two frequency generator.
