description:
Design a circuit that performs a binary search for the highest set bit in an 8-bit input. The module examines the input to determine the position of the most significant bit that is set to 1 and outputs a 3-bit binary representation of this position. If there are no set bits, the output will remain at the default value of 000. The design utilizes a series of right shifts to effectively isolate and identify the relevant bits for determining their position in a compact manner.
module top_module(
    input [7:0] in,
    output reg [2:0] pos
);

